{"cluster_id": "C-1689", "topic": "Condemn-sweep and fsck derive algorithm and digest width from the `blobs", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B011-059"], "canonical_claim": "Condemn-sweep and fsck derive algorithm and digest width from the `blobs/<algo>/...` path segment; a segment not in `algos_used` is skipped by sweep and reported as `unaccounted` by fsck.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-11-cas-mixed-algo-pools.md#task-5", "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-11-cas-mixed-algo-pools-design.md#consumers"]}
