{"cluster_id": "C-1703", "topic": "gc-scheduler-lifecycle-locking", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B013-019", "B019-106"], "canonical_claim": "`CasGcScheduler` must share one persistent `Cas::Gc` between `loop` and `runOneRoundNow`, serialize rounds with a dedicated `gc_round_mutex`, and protect lazy `gc_scheduler` creation with `gc_scheduler_mutex`. Additionally, The CAS scheduler lifecycle fix must hold `gc_scheduler_mutex` across `runOneRoundNow`, reject lazy creation after shutdown, and synchronize `cas_store` and `part_access` reads with shutdown resets.", "issue_ids": ["U#7", "\u21168"], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-12-cas-stabilization-cleanup.md#L875-L927", "docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-17-codex-triage-fix-wave.md#L180-L192"]}
{"cluster_id": "C-1704", "topic": "The `suppress_destructive` decision for a GC round must be computed once", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B013-024"], "canonical_claim": "The `suppress_destructive` decision for a GC round must be computed once in `Gc::fold`, stored in `FoldResult::suppress_destructive`, and reused by all destructive phases.", "issue_ids": ["A\u00a79#7"], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-12-cas-stabilization-cleanup.md#L1176-L1270", "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-12-cas-stabilization-cleanup-design.md#L107-L112"]}
{"cluster_id": "C-1705", "topic": "token-stability-fence-out", "target": "architecture/garbage-collection", "member_ids": ["B014-075", "B015-016"], "canonical_claim": "GC fence-out uses token-stability observation on the leader's monotonic clock: a non-terminated, non-fenced mount is fenced only after its token remains unchanged for `ttl + ttl / 20 + round_period_hint`, with a new leader starting with an empty observation map and therefore delaying fencing safely by one round. Additionally, GC fence-out uses token stability on the GC leader's own monotonic clock instead of comparing `MountLease.expires_at_ms` with the leader's wall clock.", "issue_ids": ["rev.6"], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-13-cas-ref-lease-exclusivity-rev6.md#task-9", "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-cas-ref-lease-exclusivity-rev6-design.md#gc-fence-out"]}
